## MCP - Image OCR

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/image-ocr

**InputSchema:**
```json
{
  "required": ["image_url OR image_base64", "mistral_api_key"],
  "properties": {
    "image_url": { "type": "string", "description": "URL of image to OCR" },
    "image_base64": { "type": "string", "description": "Base64-encoded image" },
    "file_type": { "type": "string", "description": "Image type (jpg, png, etc.)" },
    "mistral_api_key": { "type": "string", "description": "Mistral API key" },
    "include_images": { "type": "boolean", "description": "Include images in response", "default": false },
    "extract_header_footer": { "type": "boolean", "default": true, "description": "En-têtes et pieds sortis du markdown vers page_details[].header/footer (#363)" },
    "include_blocks": { "type": "boolean", "default": false, "description": "page_details[].blocks (#363)" },
    "table_format": { "type": "string", "enum": ["markdown", "html"], "default": "markdown", "description": "html : page_details[].tables (#363)" },
    "user_id": { "type": "string", "description": "User ID (optional, for tracing)" },
    "guild_id": { "type": "string", "description": "Guild ID (optional, for tracing)" },
    "user_request": { "type": "string", "description": "User request (optional, for tracing)" }
  }
}
```

**RFC-014 Context Support:**
```json
{
  "context": {
    "image_url": "https://...",
    "file_type": "jpg"
  },
  "plugin_context": {
    "api_keys": { "mistral": "..." }
  }
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": { "text": "...", "pages": [...], "page_details": [...], "warnings": [] },
  "meta": { "provider": "mistral" },
  "_trace": { ... }
}
```

**page_details (#363) :** même forme que `pdf-ocr` (index, markdown, header, footer, page_width, page_height, dpi ; blocks avec include_blocks ; tables avec table_format html). Pas de relance : une image = une page.

**API:** Mistral OCR (mistral-ocr-latest)

